<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Citizen Bank half yr shr falls, div dips.</title>
<headline>Citizen Bank half yr shr falls, div dips.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr ended Sept 30</p>
<p>		(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		    19.9	    vs 32.5</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		     6.6	    vs 10.8</p>
<p>    Net income		    2.5	    vs  4.08</p>
<p>    Net interest income	 6.57	   vs  5.78</p>
<p>    Other operating income    6.84	   vs  5.65</p>
<p>    Bad/doubtful debt charge  9.09	   vs  9.22</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			 2.81	   vs  4.08</p>
<p>    Tax			     0.31	   vs  0.0</p>
<p>Div payable Dec 13</p>
<p>On register Nov 22</p>
<p>Full name: Citizen Bank Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
